        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle CU-03 Registrar Llegada en Garita (SumaControl)\nautonumber\nskinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam ParticipantPadding 20\nskinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center\nskinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #99D0C8\nskinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1B365D\nskinparam ParticipantFontColor #000000\nskinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #1B365D\nskinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #99D0C8\nskinparam SequenceArrowColor #1B365D\nskinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #1B365D\nskinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontColor #000000\nskinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n\nparticipant \&quot;:OperadorGarita\&quot; as Op\nparticipant \&quot;:InterfazGarita\&quot; as UI\nparticipant \&quot;:GaritaControlador\&quot; as C\nparticipant \&quot;:Vehiculo\&quot; as V\nparticipant \&quot;:CitaLogistica\&quot; as Cita\nparticipant \&quot;:Gateway\&quot; as G\nparticipant \&quot;:Penalizacion\&quot; as Pen\nparticipant \&quot;:MotorEDA0\&quot; as Motor\n\nOp -&gt; UI : registrarLlegada(placa, horaLlegada)\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; C : POST /api/v1/llegadas(placa, horaLlegada)\nactivate C\n\nC -&gt; V : obtenerEstadoVehiculo(placa)\nactivate V\nV --&gt; C : estadoVehiculo\ndeactivate V\n\nC -&gt; Cita : evaluarTolerancia(placa, horaLlegada)\nactivate Cita\nCita --&gt; C : resultadoTolerancia\ndeactivate Cita\n\nalt RN-04: tolerancia &lt;= 15 min\n    opt RN-08: tipoCarga == &#39;CONSTRUCCION&#39;\n        C -&gt; G : verificarExclusividadGateway5(placa)\n        activate G\n        G --&gt; C : confirmacionReservaExclusiva\n        deactivate G\n    end\n    C -&gt; G : asignarBahia(placa)\n    activate G\n    G --&gt; C : bahiaAsignada\n    deactivate G\n    C -&gt;&gt; Motor : registrarAuditoria(placa)\n    C --&gt; UI : 200 OK (\&quot;Acceso Autorizado\&quot;)\nelse Excede tolerancia &gt; 15 min\n    C -&gt; Pen : registrarPenalizacion(placa)\n    activate Pen\n    Pen --&gt; C : infraccionRegistrada\n    deactivate Pen\n    C --&gt; UI : 403 Forbidden (\&quot;Acceso Rechazado: Exceso de Tolerancia\&quot;)\nend\n\ndeactivate C\nUI --&gt; Op : mostrarResultadoOperacion()\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="JnXwupyJrHBhBlrGDWMR-32">
